Package: GROMICA
Title: GROMACS Molecular Dynamics Visualization and Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Hafeez", "Ur Rehman", 
           email = "hafeez@nwafu.edu.cn", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive toolkit for visualizing and analyzing GROMACS 
    molecular dynamics simulation results. Provides easy-to-use functions for 
    RMSD (Root Mean Square Deviation), RMSF (Root Mean Square Fluctuation), 
    radius of gyration, SASA (Solvent Accessible Surface Area), and hydrogen 
    bond analysis. Generates publication-quality plots with customizable colors, 
    resolution up to 1200 DPI, and supports multi-trajectory comparison.
